                                "sense_id": "0af6f608-9c4b-3149-9d71-6201abfd4066",
                                "text": "Frank Sinatra, followed like a Pied Piper by a procession of sober-faced disciples, unshouting and undemonstrative for a change, hurried to St. Patrick's Cathedral to offer his prayers."
